cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "BettiGraphs: persistent-homology-based structural profiling of Bitcoin transaction networks"
abstract: >-
  Research pipeline computing persistent homology of Bitcoin transaction and address graphs,
  extracting Betti-curve and persistence-based representations, and evaluating them against
  conventional graph features and graph neural network baselines for illicit-activity detection
  and wallet relationship analysis on the Elliptic and Elliptic++ benchmarks.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Korde"
    given-names: "Sagar"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sagarkorde/BettiGraphs"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - persistent homology
  - Betti numbers
  - topological data analysis
  - Bitcoin
  - transaction graph
  - blockchain forensics
  - anomaly detection
  - wallet analysis
